 IPS</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>CPU</td><td>8-core, 15 W</td><td>16-core, 55 W</td><td>6-core, 15 W</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>RAM</td><td>16 GB (soldered)</td><td>32 GB (upgradeable)</td><td>16 GB</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Storage</td><td>512 GB</td><td>1,024 GB (upgradeable)</td><td>256 GB</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Rating</td><td>4.6 / 5 · 1,840 reviews</td><td>4.4 / 5 · 960 reviews</td><td>4.2 / 5 · 2,310 reviews</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-3 gap-lg\" aria-label=\"Detailed laptop comparison\">\n    <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"row between\"><h2 class=\"h3\">Aero 14</h2><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">$1,299</span></div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Light, bright, long-lasting</p>\n      <p><strong>Best for:</strong> Travel and everyday work</p>\n      <div><span class=\"stat-label\">Ports</span><p>2x USB-C · HDMI · headphone</p></div>\n      <div><span class=\"stat-label\">What owners like</span><ul><li>Gorgeous OLED panel</li><li>Great battery</li><li>Quiet under load</li></ul></div>\n      <div><span class=\"stat-label\">Trade-offs</span><ul><li>Soldered RAM</li><li>Glossy screen</li></ul></div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"row between\"><h2 class=\"h3\">Forge 16</h2><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">$1,899</span></div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Desktop power on the go</p>\n      <p><strong>Best for:</strong> Video editing, 3D and gaming</p>\n      <div><span class=\"stat-label\">Ports</span><p>2x USB-C · 3x USB-A · HDMI · Ethernet · SD card</p></div>\n      <div><span class=\"stat-label\">What owners like</span><ul><li>Fastest of the three</li><li>Upgradeable RAM and SSD</li><li>Full port selection</li></ul></div>\n      <div><span class=\"stat-label\">Trade-offs</span><ul><li>Heavy</li><li>Fans are audible</li></ul></div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <